WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.676
Today is about the letter in the middle. It is the one a guess skips.

2
00:00:04.126 --> 00:00:10.938
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.438 --> 00:00:14.018
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.518 --> 00:00:20.208
Today's words have the same first letter and the same last letter. Only the middle one changes.

5
00:00:23.647 --> 00:00:24.668
The word is pin.

6
00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:29.750
The word is pan.

7
00:00:33.653 --> 00:00:34.674
The word is pen.

8
00:00:35.574 --> 00:00:41.805
Use the slide card again. Stop on the middle letter. Your child says its sound before you slide on.

9
00:00:42.255 --> 00:00:43.921
These are the five middle sounds.

10
00:00:49.853 --> 00:00:54.352
You can hear them again on your companion page. Tap a letter there, and it plays.

11
00:00:54.802 --> 00:00:58.748
Do the first row together. Your child does the other rows with the card.

12
00:00:59.198 --> 00:01:02.570
For job two, press play on the listening track and step away.

13
00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:05.532
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
